  "description": "Everybody loves that picture-perfect view at the top of the mountain, right? Let our all new E-Escarpe open the doors to new adventures, making even the toughest climbs and terrain accessible.\n\nThe E-Escarpe shares all the traits of our award winning Escarpe platform, designed to bring you further, faster. With the reliable Shimano STEPS motor system, the E-Escarpe is ready to rip up the trails and take you to new heights.\n\nThe E-Escarpe is a smile inducing E-trail bike thanks to the modern geometry and quality suspension performance that the Marzocchi Bomber Z2 140mm E-bike specific forks and Rockshox Deluxe Select R rear shock provide. Pair that with the Shimano Deore M6000 10 Speed drivetrain, Shimano MT-501 brakes, and Shimano E7000 STEPS motor and now anything seems possible. Finished off with WTB ST rims, Maxxis 3C tubeless ready tyres, Nukeproof components and a Brand-X Ascend Dropper. The E-Escarpe is ready for an all-day trail shredding adventure.\n\nE-Escarpe 6061 Alloy Boost 140mm frame\n\nSHIMANO STEPS E7000 Motor\n\nEco, trail or Boost Power modes\n\nShimano Deore 10 speed drivetrain\n\nShimano MT-501 brakes\n\nTubeless Ready Maxxis 3C Tyres",
